WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:02.122
The “KYC / AML”

2
00:00:02.122 --> 00:00:05.302
tab is the know-your-client checklist for life business.

3
00:00:05.605 --> 00:00:09.842
It shows whether the file is complete, and if not, what is missing.

4
00:00:10.942 --> 00:00:13.589
The ID card or passport is uploaded

5
00:00:13.589 --> 00:00:16.190
to the encrypted document vault, in the “Identity”

6
00:00:16.190 --> 00:00:20.008
category, and chosen here, with its expiry date.

7
00:00:20.311 --> 00:00:22.528
The number stays on the document only;

8
00:00:22.831 --> 00:00:26.105
if a field looks like it holds an identity, passport,

9
00:00:26.105 --> 00:00:29.947
tax or bank number, the CRM asks you to remove it.

10
00:00:31.047 --> 00:00:33.682
The checklist asks whether the client is a politically

11
00:00:33.682 --> 00:00:37.652
exposed person, or a close family member or associate of one,

12
00:00:37.955 --> 00:00:39.858
now or in the last twelve months;

13
00:00:40.103 --> 00:00:41.309
the source of funds;

14
00:00:41.554 --> 00:00:42.714
the beneficiaries;

15
00:00:42.901 --> 00:00:44.525
and the risk.

16
00:00:45.625 --> 00:00:49.154
If you leave the next review empty, it is set from the check date:

17
00:00:49.526 --> 00:00:53.647
one year for high risk, three for standard, five for low.

18
00:00:53.949 --> 00:00:56.595
Before the date, a reminder is created.

19
00:00:57.695 --> 00:00:59.784
Keep only what the checklist asks for.

20
00:00:59.971 --> 00:01:02.477
The document stays in the encrypted vault,

21
00:01:02.502 --> 00:01:05.740
and access to restricted documents is logged.

22
00:01:06.840 --> 00:01:07.977
In the next lesson:

23
00:01:08.349 --> 00:01:10.752
documents and electronic signature.
